{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2023-02-02 14:06:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP INC. NAMES SLATE OF DIRECTOR NOMINEES', 'text': "CHICAGO , FEB. 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP INC., THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS NOMINATED TWO NEW DIRECTOR CANDIDATES, HAROLD FORD JR. AND KATHRYN BENESH, FOR ELECTION AT ITS 2023 ANNUAL MEETING TO BE HELD THURSDAY, MAY 4, 2023. THE TWO NEW NOMINEES WILL JOIN THE FOLLOWING CURRENT DIRECTORS STANDING FOR RE-ELECTION: TERRENCE A."}